  "transcriptHash": "baba64feb5b7ab7977bf1015e81e7258a9abe03c46376491081ea476734b2697",
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "tutorial-backup-restore-01",
      "markerIndex": 0,
      "replayStartSec": 2.799671,
      "replayEndSec": 9.00514,
      "narrationText": "先从必须存活下来的东西说起。在正在运行的 repository 里，有一个文件保存着一条订单记录。留意它，因为我们马上就要让这台机器下线，再从别处把这条记录找回来。",
      "audioSrc": "/assets/tutorials/audio/zh/tutorial-backup-restore/tutorial-backup-restore-01.91f0d1d2.mp3",
      "textHash": "91f0d1d2d348ddd7c068e04ce86210f8af5a0752969aaa8e432e2725be2551a1",
      "audioDurationSec": 13.464,
      "afterAudioSrc": "/assets/tutorials/audio/zh/tutorial-backup-restore/tutorial-backup-restore-01-after.51a4fb79.mp3",
      "afterAudioDurationSec": 5.16,
      "afterTextHash": "51a4fb799f4e05efecd9b998d2a05bd9e19cbeba402bb55d79de377695ee2d8e"
    },
    {
      "id": "tutorial-backup-restore-02",
      "markerIndex": 1,
      "replayStartSec": 9.00514,
      "replayEndSec": 17.993741,
      "narrationText": "把整个 repository 复制到第二台机器上。第一次复制会通过 SSH 传输整个加密镜像，在这里大约两吉字节，用时半分钟。到达另一端的是一个备份产物，而不是第二个正在运行的应用。",
      "audioSrc": "/assets/tutorials/audio/zh/tutorial-backup-restore/tutorial-backup-restore-02.57947af1.mp3",
      "textHash": "57947af1cf1c5bdbf41757d6220799b40609e5b7816db94fb5e50437b0544a8d",
      "audioDurationSec": 16.032,
      "afterAudioSrc": "/assets/tutorials/audio/zh/tutorial-backup-restore/tutorial-backup-restore-02-after.ccc0f050.mp3",
      "afterAudioDurationSec": 2.112,
      "afterTextHash": "ccc0f050d47c40478eee391211fb9942aea1b9819f5b265642dd0630779f7b3d"
    },
    {
      "id": "tutorial-backup-restore-03",
      "markerIndex": 2,
      "replayStartSec": 17.993741,
      "replayEndSec": 23.318642,
      "narrationText": "查看备份机器上保存了什么。repository 就在那里，用它自己的名字。第二行，也就是显示原始标识符的那一行，是保留下来的基准，它让下一次推送只需要发送变化的部分。",
      "audioSrc": "/assets/tutorials/audio/zh/tutorial-backup-restore/tutorial-backup-restore-03.8a5d7152.mp3",
      "textHash": "8a5d7152c056c60f27cc3587df9ce066991108d21c786c0effb6e97232df6532",
      "audioDurationSec": 13.32,
      "afterAudioSrc": "/assets/tutorials/audio/zh/tutorial-backup-restore/tutorial-backup-restore-03-after.789bb036.mp3",
      "afterAudioDurationSec": 5.472,
      "afterTextHash": "789bb0364081772dfa5ab6232c01a59fba5b5db0b0c5a18591e76ff1b5d1dca1"
    },
    {
      "id": "tutorial-backup-restore-04",
      "markerIndex": 3,
      "replayStartSec": 23.318642,
      "replayEndSec": 28.951964,
      "narrationText": "现在是灾难时刻。停止主机器，并卸载它的加密卷。对这台机器来说，应用已经不存在了。",
      "audioSrc": "/assets/tutorials/audio/zh/tutorial-backup-restore/tutorial-backup-restore-04.f946e18e.mp3",
      "textHash": "f946e18e8ca1b2849c1632d1419f3cf36f54cc8c74189fa93f1a2cc7b927797d",
      "audioDurationSec": 8.832,
      "afterAudioSrc": "/assets/tutorials/audio/zh/tutorial-backup-restore/tutorial-backup-restore-04-after.6bd8c6d7.mp3",
      "afterAudioDurationSec": 4.2,
      "afterTextHash": "6bd8c6d79b05abf932108efe669ac7b19033267062746afbd6f82386718e5632"
    },
    {
      "id": "tutorial-backup-restore-05",
      "markerIndex": 4,
      "replayStartSec": 28.951964,
      "replayEndSec": 39.005334,
      "narrationText": "把这个产物变成一个正在运行的 repository。做这件事的命令是 restore。一个参数给新的 repository 命名，一个参数指定它放在备份机器上，还有一个参数跳过确认。",
      "audioSrc": "/assets/tutorials/audio/zh/tutorial-backup-restore/tutorial-backup-restore-05.36f4fbf9.mp3",
      "textHash": "36f4fbf996b69374cb32ed41949e9369caa3b128f233a615730e9c6678221f14",
      "audioDurationSec": 13.32,
      "afterAudioSrc": "/assets/tutorials/audio/zh/tutorial-backup-restore/tutorial-backup-restore-05-after.c62cae06.mp3",
      "afterAudioDurationSec": 3.72,
      "afterTextHash": "c62cae0618002ca9239157f0758c1fe6a62eb1022a8df2d7966690c7756166f1"
    },
    {
      "id": "tutorial-backup-restore-06",
      "markerIndex": 5,
      "replayStartSec": 39.005334,
      "replayEndSec": 46.52408,
      "narrationText": "挂载恢复出来的 repository。我们特意不启动它的容器，因为我们想要证明的是数据，而不是应用本身。",
      "audioSrc": "/assets/tutorials/audio/zh/tutorial-backup-restore/tutorial-backup-restore-06.8b2addde.mp3",
      "textHash": "8b2addde61fecd3b15cf883e6f3eb6c72a9acfd2fbeaaad61d67c26e470bb01e",
      "audioDurationSec": 8.184,
      "afterAudioSrc": "/assets/tutorials/audio/zh/tutorial-backup-restore/tutorial-backup-restore-06-after.f16f5c48.mp3",
      "afterAudioDurationSec": 1.944,
      "afterTextHash": "f16f5c48a5cd7637636152d20d7ea70219eb56dfd8101491eb45bf3a05031562"
    },
    {
      "id": "tutorial-backup-restore-07",
      "markerIndex": 6,
      "replayStartSec": 46.52408,
      "replayEndSec": 52.091103,
      "narrationText": "和一开始运行的完全相同的命令，这次针对的是两条命令之前还根本不存在的 repository。同一个文件，同一条记录，同一笔订单。",
      "audioSrc": "/assets/tutorials/audio/zh/tutorial-backup-restore/tutorial-backup-restore-07.76778a47.mp3",
      "textHash": "76778a473b601b54995c594ed8026b2b00eaa3228f9e3a4ab50ccc1eb880ac30",
      "audioDurationSec": 10.44,
      "afterAudioSrc": "/assets/tutorials/audio/zh/tutorial-backup-restore/tutorial-backup-restore-07-after.7b115448.mp3",
      "afterAudioDurationSec": 3.552,
      "afterTextHash": "7b1154482def9aced4c1263a43bb30496d1b0d7d465b6a6357741526a8daf1f5"
    },
    {
      "id": "tutorial-backup-restore-08",
      "markerIndex": 7,
      "replayStartSec": 52.091103,
      "replayEndSec": 53.948429,
      "narrationText": "还有一点，关于可以让你回溯的备份。快照会发送到分块存储：第一次运行会上传全部内容，之后每次运行只上传变更的块。任何快照都可以单独恢复。这需要账户和已授权的 repository，所以这里只输入命令，不会执行。",
      "audioSrc": "/assets/tutorials/audio/zh/tutorial-backup-restore/tutorial-backup-restore-08.cc4303e0.mp3",
      "textHash": "cc4303e076f154085da5a51be743d43aabfaae546782c23403472bf4c8008a07",
      "audioDurationSec": 18.432,
      "afterAudioSrc": "/assets/tutorials/audio/zh/tutorial-backup-restore/tutorial-backup-restore-08-after.fb7d9dbd.mp3",
      "afterAudioDurationSec": 5.64,
      "afterTextHash": "fb7d9dbd07fb8a44fd8bd8549a2a1fb774ddf82f43f771ec3e319a6d439f2ad2"
    }
  ],
  "narrationAudio": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "textHash": "f50ce02c0a6ccb694a660f30eda073c447277d39a8f43e88ec6a5503c446746d",
      "audioSrc": "/assets/tutorials/audio/zh/tutorial-backup-restore/intro.f50ce02c.mp3",
      "narrationText": "你的应用已经上线，那就来确保它绝不会丢失！在本教程中，我们会把整个 repository 复制到第二台机器上，让第一台下线，然后把数据找回来。",
      "audioDurationSec": 11.712
    },
    {
      "id": "three-steps",
      "textHash": "05885bf34312b93461fedc092d31ce6a1875a0572f28d4e7a528a57164f3e9cf",
      "audioSrc": "/assets/tutorials/audio/zh/tutorial-backup-restore/three-steps.05885bf3.mp3",
      "narrationText": "归结起来就是三个步骤：把 repository 复制到你控制的机器上，把这份副本恢复成一个独立的 repository，然后通过重新读出数据来验证它。",
      "audioDurationSec": 10.272
    },
    {
      "id": "next-tutorial",
      "textHash": "ae65de39a743669bb37f75af90044150461a8b8e371383c184bb22d353a9abde",
      "audioSrc": "/assets/tutorials/audio/zh/tutorial-backup-restore/next-tutorial.ae65de39.mp3",
      "narrationText": "你的数据安全且可在机器间移植。下个教程见！",
      "audioDurationSec": 4.2,
